---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import personalImage from "../assets/images/me.webp";

const personalImageAlt = "Alexandre Spindola";
---

<article
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-300 md:flex-row"
>
  <div
    class="order-2 text-pretty [&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-primary md:order-1"
  >
    <p>
      AI-Native Full-Stack Engineer building automation, AI-enabled products and
      web platforms. I work across product discovery, architecture, implementation
      and operations to turn legacy workflows into dependable systems.
    </p>

    <p>
      Based in Cologne, Germany · Spanish EU citizen · GCP Associate Cloud Engineer
      · MBA in Software Engineering (USP)
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>AI & Automation:</strong> Azure OpenAI, RAG, pgvector, embeddings,
      structured outputs, n8n, Puppeteer and event-driven workflows<br
      />
      <strong>Full-Stack:</strong> Go, NestJS, Hono, SvelteKit, Astro, Vue/Nuxt,
      PostgreSQL, typed SQL and OpenAPI<br />
      <strong>Cloud & Reliability:</strong> GCP, Docker, Cloudflare, CI/CD, queues,
      workers, retries and distributed locks<br />
      <strong>Integrations:</strong> Magento 2, Shopify, Holded ERP, OAuth, GDPR-aware
      flows and headless CMS
    </p>
  </div>
  <Image
    src={personalImage}
    width={256}
    height={256}
    alt={personalImageAlt}
    class="order-1 aspect-square h-full w-64 rotate-3 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/5 p-1 object-cover ring-1 ring-white/20 md:order-2 lg:w-64 lg:p-2"
    style="object-position: 50% 50%"
  />
</article>
